WEBVTT

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.710
Amazing.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.060
I had no idea our agency had a resort house like this.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:58.340
<b><i>Fantasia of the Stars</i></b>

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:58.540
With everything from recording studios to hot springs,

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.720
it's a special facility.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.510
I haven't had a break in a long time.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.140
I'm really going to enjoy this!

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.270
It's a special arrangement from Shining,

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.270
so make sure you don't cut loose too much.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.150
I know that.

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.110
Well, then...

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.360
I'm going to the training room.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.240
What?!

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.380
Ichinose, don't tell us...

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:26.660
You're going to train out here?

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.620
Tokiya, we came here together. Hang out with us!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.630
Let's go fishing and have a barbecue.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.610
Wouldn't it be all right once in a while?

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.470
Teamwork is important to the group too.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.740
Oh, whoops. Did I say something unlike myself?

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.220
What was that about?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.520
Ichinose.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.630
I have no choice, then.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.820
I'll go with you.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.200
Really? All right!

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.160
Let's start with that barbecue!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.240
Yeah, let's get ready!

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:05.580
Why do we have to accompany them on their vacation?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:10.290
Because no one knows what they'll do if we leave them on their own.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:15.540
It's a vacation for us as well.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.720
Each of us should spend it as we see fit.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.210
Yay!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.800
Is everybody having fun?

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.390
Why don't we all go fishing together?

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.780
Go by yourself.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.680
I pass.

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:32.430
What? Rei-chan sad...

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.700
They're like children, aren't they?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.540
I agree completely.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:55.340
Does he really need the lady's song that quickly?

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:58.340
He must be planning our next release soon.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:02.800
The president handles all of those matters.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:06.390
Is there anything we can do to help her?

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:10.890
Composing is her work alone.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.330
It's best to leave her be right now.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.600
I agree.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.870
This voice...

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:26.280
Cecil?

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:32.040
<i>I know it's late, but please accept it.</i>

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.510
<i>You wrote a song for me?</i>

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.730
<i>I hope you like it.</i>

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.120
Cecil!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.170
It really is Cecil.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:49.350
When did you get here?

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.430
Cecil!

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.810
You're here. I'm so happy.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.560
Is this...

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.280
Isn't it Nanami's song?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.760
No!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.070
Where did you get this?

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:14.660
Haruka gave it to me.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.830
What?!

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.210
You finally got yours?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:22.420
You're so lucky to get one of Haru-chan's songs.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.170
Didn't you get one too?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.760
That's great, Cecil.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.260
I'm honestly happy for you.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.140
Thank you.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.180
You haven't written lyrics yet, have you?

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.320
If there's anything you don't understand, let us know.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.690
If you need phrases of love, I'd be happy to give you advice any time.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:44.440
Oh...

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:49.660
That's great. Now your wish has come true.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:53.930
We're all friends who have received songs from Haruka.

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:56.180
Not everything makes people friends.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:04.040
<i>This is Shou and Shinomiya's harmony,</i>

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:05.860
<i>and everyone will sing the last part.</i>

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:11.760
<i>I wrote a few songs. If you would choose one of them...</i>

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:17.930
<i>That's great. Keep writing more songs.</i>

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:18.980
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.060
<i>This is a battle of numbers.</i>

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.900
<i>The more you compose, the more likely you are to produce a hit.</i>

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:31.360
<i>This is different from when I wrote our debut song, <i>Maji LOVE 1000%</i>.</i>

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:35.430
<i>It should be enough to have one good song.</i>

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:39.800
<i>If the president hasn't approved anything...</i>

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:44.740
My song must be missing something.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.710
No, I can't doubt myself.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.060
I need to keep it together.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.500
This is...?

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:18.060
Everyone, thank you very much.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.790
Masa, that was a good idea.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.760
We simply did what we should do.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:43.220
<i>That's great. Now your wish has come true.</i>

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.290
<i>My wish...</i>

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:54.060
<i>My desire is to sing songs you have written for me.</i>

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:56.280
<i>That is all.</i>

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.950
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:07.080
<i>Nothing is more important to me than you, Haruka.</i>

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.970
<i>You gave me lots of love.</i>

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:19.070
<i>Not only that, but you are the one who saved me.</i>

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:30.880
<i>I was finally freed from my ancient curse by the power of your music back then.</i>

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.910
<i>I must return the favor.</i>

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.460
<i>I entered the Master Course to do just that.</i>

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:49.140
<i>I believed I would have the chance as long as I was by your side.</i>

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.460
<i>And yet...</i>

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.420
I...

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.600
I...

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.180
It's so late already.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.320
I wonder if they're already done making dinner.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.030
Cecil?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.380
What's wrong? What are you doing here?

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.000
It's time for dinner. Let's go together.

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.130
I can't.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:30.430
Huh?

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:36.420
C-Cecil?

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:39.230
Haruka, I...

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:44.970
I can't hold back anymore...

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.460
C-Cecil?

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.400
Cecil.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:02.010
I can't hold my feelings back anymore.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.800
I love you.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.870
C-Cecil?!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.720
I came here to make you happy...

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.440
Only you...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.980
And yet I...

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:20.140
I can't forget all their smiles.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:30.400
I want to see the smiles of all kinds of people, not just yours.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:36.610
I want to become an idol.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:37.860
What?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:44.370
I want to become an idol and make lots of people happy.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.180
Cecil, is that true?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:55.140
I'm sorry, Haruka. I have failed at being your prince.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:55.840
What?

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:03.640
You have given me so much, but I have given you nothing in return.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.260
That's not true.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:09.410
You gave me something valuable.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:10.100
What?

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:18.690
<i>Receiving life from one stem, they bloom impressively.</i>

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:23.280
The formation of ST☆RISH...

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:26.660
Cecil, please become an idol.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:31.110
It makes me happy.

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:36.180
The truth is, I've always thought how wonderful

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:37.880
it would be if you became an idol.

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:45.050
Because I know you'll make lots of people happy.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:51.610
Haruka, are you sure?

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:52.890
I support your decision.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.900
Thank you.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.870
Say what?!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:09.290
Cecil wants to become an idol?

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.680
What?

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:16.750
Why not? I'll support him.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:20.590
Well, he does have the right character.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.540
It's just a casual suggestion.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:27.790
I can't have people becoming idols over something like that.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.520
He seemed to be studying seriously lately.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.480
That must have been what it was about.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.570
Could he have been wondering about it for a while?

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:42.240
Now that you mention it, he hasn't spent any time with us since coming here.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.510
So, where's Ceci?

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:49.620
He said his heart was so full he didn't want to eat anything.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:52.360
His heart was full?

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:57.790
Unbelievable. After insisting he wasn't interested in becoming an idol...

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:01.340
All right! Let's go tease him after we eat.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:03.280
What?

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:08.010
Well, he can't help being teased for this.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:16.890
Right?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.070
Oh, guys.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.280
Now that that's decided, let's eat!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.890
This will be so much fun.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.620
To think I would want to become an idol...

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:45.170
It's funny. I understand others, but I don't understand myself.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.360
Oh, Muses, who protect us...

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:58.350
May everything transpire according to your wishes.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:05.920
Should you desire, show yourselves in this tune.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.780
This is...

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:02.880
Muses, I am grateful for your love and grace.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:09.750
"Tracing the starry sky, pointing my finger at the heavens..."

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.930
What great poetry.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:18.800
This song will connect people with the gods.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.620
Look, everyone.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.920
The stars are so beautiful.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.360
You're right.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.260
That's amazing.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.490
You can't see them so clearly in the heart of the city.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:39.300
It's wonderful.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.750
They're just like you.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:42.890
What?

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:48.400
They twinkle so much, I could stare at them forever.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:49.710
Nanami.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.770
I'm happy to hear that.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:53.430
Is that a confession of love?

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:54.760
Wha-?!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.350
N-No, I...

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:03.980
Gazing at the stars with everyone like this is nice.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:04.900
Yeah.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:10.280
By the way, Nanami, how's the new song coming along?

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:17.120
Well, I've finished a few, but nothing I'm satisfied with yet.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.780
Don't worry about it.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.500
That's right.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.370
You still have time, don't you?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.110
Work hard.

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:26.500
We support you, My Lady.

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.090
I'll do my best.

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:43.360
<i>They all sparkle, and it makes me want to watch them forever...</i>

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.360
I understand now.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.700
<i>An idol must charm people.</i>

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.720
<i>It's all thanks to them.</i>

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:10.150
<i>They made me realize how wonderful it is to be an idol.</i>

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:15.640
<i>I know you'll make lots of people happy.</i>

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.180
I am grateful.

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:25.350
Music connects people and the gods.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.870
Muses, I offer you this prayer.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.280
This feels great.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.080
A song?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.710
What is that?

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.970
What was that?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.600
It sounded really good.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.750
Yeah, I can't believe it.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.310
It's a miracle.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:37.860
The Muses were in that harmony just now.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:43.200
Could it be Cecil's voice goes really well with ours?

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:52.160
"Spinning seven, I create a constellation."

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.310
This is the will of the muses.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.840
This is what you wanted to show me...

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:04.500
That I should not sing as one, but as seven.

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:11.980
Cecil's voice was the thing missing from my new song.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.140
The answer was always right by my side.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.690
Please, Cecil!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.900
Sing with everyone as a member of ST☆RISH!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.440
Nanami?

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.910
Me? A member of ST☆RISH?

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.130
Hold on! You can't suddenly...

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:38.040
Please. Let me write a song for the seven of you.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.050
I'm sure I'll be able to write an even more wonderful song.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:45.730
I'm all for it.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.220
You...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:55.810
Since the first time I heard Cecil sing, I've wanted to sing with him.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.730
Like Nanami says,

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:02.500
if we really do need Aijima's voice in our new song...

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:06.400
Why don't you try writing one song to try it out?

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:11.040
I would like to confirm whether or not that harmony was real.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:13.120
Cecil, are you okay with it?

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:18.960
Haruka, if that is what you desire...

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.670
Then I shall follow it.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.800
Thank you.

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:29.430
If Nanami says so, I guess it's okay.

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:32.050
Seriously?

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:34.980
This is getting crazy.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.420
<i>Aijima as a member of ST☆</i>RISH...

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.700
That harmony. Just thinking of it makes my heart pound.

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:51.700
I want to sing with them again.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:54.620
A letter?

00:21:55.690 --> 00:21:56.920
It's from the king.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:03.970
<i>A little bird told me your curse was lifted.</i>

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:07.940
<i>I am thinking of giving the crown to you.</i>

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:11.820
<i>Return to Agnapolis at once.</i>

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:17.070
Why is this happening now?

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:27.150
Aijima?
